    <string name="fast_start_title">Start without asking</string>
    <string name="fast_start_body">Android asks for permission every time a recording starts. With Shizuku, DenRecorder can press the system\'s Share screen button itself, so one tap is enough: the dialog flashes by and the recording starts. The permission is still Android\'s own, shown on your screen, and this only works while Shizuku is running.</string>
    <string name="fast_start_enable">Turn on</string>
    <string name="fast_start_need_title">Shizuku is needed</string>
    <string name="fast_start_need_body">Starting without the question needs Shizuku, because only an app with its permission can press a system button. Install Shizuku, start it (wireless debugging or root), then turn this on again.</string>
    <string name="fast_start_denied_body">Shizuku did not allow DenRecorder. Turn this on again and choose Allow in Shizuku\'s dialog.</string>
    <string name="fast_start_on_toast">Recordings start on their own now</string>
    <string name="fast_start_off_toast">The question is back before every recording</string>
